<title>USA: NYC Housing Corp $26 mln repriced, yields cut.</title>
<headline>NYC Housing Corp $26 mln repriced, yields cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bear, Stearns &amp; Co., Inc. said Wednesday it repriced NYC Housing Development Corps $26 million bond deal, lowering the top yield to 5.875 percent from 5.90 percent and also cutting yields in several other maturities.</p>
</text>
